                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0eea1ffe-a50e-40fe-8fba-95b9f1dac245",
                        "entry_id": "8e942877-e120-31fd-a272-7771c679e7b7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "indésirables"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0be5ac60-34e7-3202-9765-f567b4896be3",
                        "entry_id": "8e942877-e120-31fd-a272-7771c679e7b7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Que l’on ne peut pas désirer."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "49a4a851-a141-4e0e-bf60-2ca5f69bb197",
                                "sense_id": "0be5ac60-34e7-3202-9765-f567b4896be3",
                                "text": "Sous une royauté, le pouvoir est presque inaccessible ; il peut, sans trop de danger, être environné de séductions ; mais sous une république, c’est autre chose ; une émeute peut le donner à qui le rêve : il faut donc le rendre austère, ennuyeux, pénible, indésirable enfin, pour en dégoûter les rêveurs ambitieux."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ee91597a-f0af-37e0-8972-cf4714e11351",
                        "entry_id": "8e942877-e120-31fd-a272-7771c679e7b7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dont la présence ou l’existence est une gêne, un défaut, une nuisance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0491567-92d1-4d4e-9461-d4e596e30c43",
                                "sense_id": "ee91597a-f0af-37e0-8972-cf4714e11351",
                                "text": "Dans nombre de cas, l’addition de désoxydants à de telles coulées est indésirable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d52722e1-a69c-4357-9c89-37f1bc98da86",
                                "sense_id": "ee91597a-f0af-37e0-8972-cf4714e11351",
                                "text": "L’Ambassadeur du Burkina vient de me demander de lui prêter main forte pour appréhender un étudiant indésirable qui vient d’arriver sur notre sol. Quelqu’un qui est indésirable chez lui ne saurait être désiré en France, aussi ai-je accédé à sa demande."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c454dbfc-643e-4fcf-9700-4d5ceff79450",
                                "sense_id": "ee91597a-f0af-37e0-8972-cf4714e11351",
                                "text": "Si le médicament se retrouvait sur le marché et si six mois après, des effets indésirables étaient constatés, ces mêmes personnes nous le reprocheraient."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e58a79fe-736d-4308-9903-b26c850bd0b0",
                                "sense_id": "ee91597a-f0af-37e0-8972-cf4714e11351",
                                "text": "Le courrier indésirable est également appelé : spam, pourriel, junk mail, courrier rebut..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8a09cf2a-f599-4bd4-8b0c-588351a03121",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e942877-e120-31fd-a272-7771c679e7b7",
                        "target_lang_word": "unerwünscht",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unerwünscht",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4d24c5b-217e-3295-bde0-fc203523f0a7",
                                        "entry_id": "a2698038-6b33-3cbf-a2c0-52a63145b5d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nicht gewollt, nicht willkommen, entbehrlich"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45b48511-fd17-47a6-9669-3dc1d44a0e61",
                                                "sense_id": "f4d24c5b-217e-3295-bde0-fc203523f0a7",
                                                "text": "Dein unerwünschter Gast hat sich ja noch immer nicht verabschiedet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74a44ef9-0dd5-46bf-b0be-e8ea57656ec5",
                                                "sense_id": "f4d24c5b-217e-3295-bde0-fc203523f0a7",
                                                "text": "„Risiken beim Einsatz gentechnisch veränderter Pflanzen sind neben einer Bedrohung der Artenvielfalt auch Nebeneffekte wie das Auftreten neuer unerwünschter Eigenschaften bei den Pflanzen, aber auch allergische Reaktionen bei den Verbrauchern.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d111030-5fd2-4fc7-b2f2-f817d65a4431",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e942877-e120-31fd-a272-7771c679e7b7",
                        "target_lang_word": "undesirable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "undesirable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d1b6713-ba16-3bf5-bfcb-870a54057902",
                                        "entry_id": "f00a705e-c5df-3180-b7a8-f875770f3622",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Objectionable or not likely to please."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7888c113-3dd3-4be3-b01e-635412434ece",
                                                "sense_id": "9d1b6713-ba16-3bf5-bfcb-870a54057902",
                                                "text": "There would be no need for any of the animals to come in contact with human beings, which would clearly be most undesirable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0aeff569-c360-44a2-9d6d-d47a9a8e8edd",
                                                "sense_id": "9d1b6713-ba16-3bf5-bfcb-870a54057902",
                                                "text": "Chronic venous disease includes cosmetically undesirable telangiectasias, varicose veins, venous ulceration, and claudication."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88d56620-3fa8-4c2d-b2a9-a80cb0812d92",
                                                "sense_id": "9d1b6713-ba16-3bf5-bfcb-870a54057902",
                                                "text": "[David] Brog spoke movingly of his immigrant grandfather as a triumph of the assimilationist model—a Romanian Jew who emigrated to America, learned English, and became a good patriotic American—but failed to mention that the 1924 Immigration Act was designed specifically to exclude Eastern European Jews (among other undesirable European ethnic groups) from entering the country."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "undesirable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f002ea6-96b6-3680-8008-ca9bed45b43a",
                                        "entry_id": "bf206500-302f-345a-9256-9a9e2bb01a07",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An undesirable person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in-plural",
                                            "often"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "927254ca-717e-4334-a3ed-d16c93e858a7",
                                                "sense_id": "9f002ea6-96b6-3680-8008-ca9bed45b43a",
                                                "text": "Barskiven Road was The Undesirables. Bad corporation tenants (didn't pay their rents, didn't dig their gardens, let their kids smash up windows) were transferred to The Undesirables until they showed they'd improved. His mother called them scum. Barskiven Road houses had all-metal fittings. Only the window panes could be broken, unless you had a blow-torch. McCann said they'd have them, soon. At the dancing blokes always made jokes if they knew a dame was from The Undesirables. It was supposed to be the worst street in the whole of Kilcaddie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ea95581-6bf2-41cb-8ae6-147e09c18f4e",
                                                "sense_id": "9f002ea6-96b6-3680-8008-ca9bed45b43a",
                                                "text": "The Matchmaking Festival provided social events for these lonely-hearted pilgrims, and allowed local personages to keep undesirables away from their daughters."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb97b0c8-aa54-4a7b-b4ff-62f30715c61b",
                                                "sense_id": "9f002ea6-96b6-3680-8008-ca9bed45b43a",
                                                "text": "The Camden Bench is not an anomaly: more and more, our cities are being designed to keep those deemed as ‘undesirables’ out. By its very nature this is ‘hostile architecture’—urban design with a focus on exclusion, design that inhibits community and tells us who is welcome and who is not."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
